1
00:00:00,324 --> 00:00:01,854
(Bert:)I bet if we put
our heads together,

2
00:00:01,859 --> 00:00:03,489
(Bert:)we could come up
with a solution.

3
00:00:03,494 --> 00:00:05,394
(Sheldon:)We... Hang on.

4
00:00:05,396 --> 00:00:07,726
(Sheldon:)You're my enemy.

5
00:00:07,732 --> 00:00:10,332
(Sheldon:)Now, the enemy of the enemy
is my friend.

6
00:00:10,334 --> 00:00:12,704
(Sheldon:)And right now,
I'm my own worst enemy.

7
00:00:12,703 --> 00:00:14,803
(Sheldon:)That makes you my fr--
Okay, I'm good to go.

8
00:00:16,307 --> 00:00:17,537
(Leonard:)Great.

9
00:00:17,542 --> 00:00:18,942
(Bert:)Now that we're friends,
want to see if we can

10
00:00:18,943 --> 00:00:21,473
(Bert:)get tickets
to a taping of Ellen?

11
00:00:24,148 --> 00:00:25,778
(Sheldon:)You know what?
This isn't gonna work.

12
00:00:25,783 --> 00:00:29,383
(Bert:)Sheldon... wait.

13
00:00:29,387 --> 00:00:32,587
(Bert:)You know, you've got
a lot to be happy about.

14
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:34,590
(Bert:)You're at the top
of your field,

15
00:00:34,592 --> 00:00:36,492
(Bert:)you have a great girlfriend.

16
00:00:36,494 --> 00:00:38,264
Yes! That's right!

17
00:00:38,262 --> 00:00:40,232
I have Amy!

18
00:00:43,367 --> 00:00:46,307
(Sheldon:)In the past, you've
professed feelings for her.

19
00:00:46,304 --> 00:00:47,774
(Sheldon:)Does it eat you up inside

20
00:00:47,772 --> 00:00:48,802
(Sheldon:)that I have her
and you don't?

21
00:00:48,806 --> 00:00:51,406
(Bert:)It used to.

22
00:00:51,409 --> 00:00:53,209
(Bert:)But now that I'm rich
and successful,

23
00:00:53,211 --> 00:00:55,311
(Bert:)I think I can do better.

24
00:00:57,515 --> 00:01:01,025
(Sheldon:)I can't believe
you punched Bert.

